 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Email is perfect for that. Keep it short and include a link to the wedding website so people can see it' real. Then tell her straight that it' already been sent out and she's not getting special guest pass. A simple note like that is polite and clear. She'll likely laugh and move on. Most people do. If she pushy, then one on one, tell her the wedding is already full and she missed out. Definitely. Then you can toast the couple without her spoiling the mood. Good plan. Email is your friend, and remember to keep it short and friendly.",
